# Approved test snapshots must materialize with CRLF in the working tree on every
# platform and every core.autocrlf setting: the compared-against output comes from
# System.Xml serialization whose default NewLineChars is CRLF everywhere.
*.snapshot.svg text eol=crlf

# Shell scripts must materialize with LF on every platform: the cluster's Windows
# machines run core.autocrlf=true, and bash rejects a CRLF shebang with
# `CR: command not found` - a .sh versioned without this rule is delivered broken
# to the next clone. Applies to the triage organs under scripts/.
*.sh text eol=lf
